    "# \ufe0f Glu-Stock: 00c_LLM_STRATEGY_AUDIT\n",
    "**Phase**: Strategic Intelligence (The Auditor) | v18.24 (High Hierarchy)\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook uses a Large Language Model (Gemma-7B) to perform a final strategic audit on quantitative signals. \n",
    "**Higher Hierarchy**: The LLM has VETO power. If the LLM reasoning is negative, the signal is dropped regardless of ensemble scores."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
